OL,3,GNEWSASection of A27 closed after lorry
OL,4,Aoverturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the A27 in West Sussex has
OL,7,Fbeen closed after a lorry overturned in
OL,8,Fthe early hours.
OL,10,FThe eastbound carriageway between
OL,11,FArundel and Worthing is shut after the
OL,12,Florry overturned near Angmering just
OL,13,Fafter 03:30 BST.
OL,15,FThe closure is causing delays, and a
OL,16,FSussex Police force spokesperson said
OL,17,Fdrivers should "find alternative
OL,18,Froutes" and "avoid the area while we
OL,19,Frespond to this incident".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
